1
00:00:00,254 --> 00:00:01,744
(Penny:)Who's ready for another beer?

2
00:00:01,923 --> 00:00:03,153
- I'm good.
- No, thank you.

3
00:00:03,691 --> 00:00:05,061
(Penny:)Girls.

4
00:00:06,194 --> 00:00:08,894
I am having the nicest time.

5
00:00:09,063 --> 00:00:11,693
(Raj:)You guys are like family to me.
You know that, right?

6
00:00:11,866 --> 00:00:13,596
(Leonard:)That's great. Get out.

7
00:00:14,435 --> 00:00:17,925
- What? Why?
- Penny and I have some issues to talk about.

8
00:00:18,105 --> 00:00:21,045
(Raj:)Oh, pish on your issues.

9
00:00:21,876 --> 00:00:23,576
(Raj:)You guys are fine.

10
00:00:23,878 --> 00:00:26,308
Yes, you've had some bumps
along the way.

11
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:29,810
(Raj:)I mean, Penny, you've always known
how this man has felt about you.

12
00:00:29,984 --> 00:00:32,284
(Raj:)But you made him grovel for affection.

13
00:00:32,453 --> 00:00:34,713
- Okay, hold on...
- Don't blame yourself.

14
00:00:34,889 --> 00:00:36,789
He was a groveler from way back.

15
00:00:38,492 --> 00:00:42,222
(Raj:)But the point is,
the two of you got past it.

16
00:00:42,430 --> 00:00:46,260
And you go and propose to this poor girl
in the middle of sex?

17
00:00:46,434 --> 00:00:48,424
(Raj:)That was some weak tea, dude.

18
00:00:49,937 --> 00:00:51,907
(Leonard:)Some people might say it was romantic.

19
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:53,600
(Raj:)Yeah, no.

20
00:00:55,009 --> 00:00:57,949
(Raj:)But yet, here you two are still together.

21
00:00:58,613 --> 00:01:01,083
(Raj:)Even after you and I
had our crazy naked night.

